# Credentials that let Claude finish a job without waiting for you.
#
# Copy this file to .adair-secrets in the same folder and fill in the values.
# That file is git-ignored and never leaves your machine: the scripts below read
# it, use it, and never print it. Leave a line blank to keep that job manual.

# github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new
#   Repository access : Only select repositories -> Meetadair/adair-travel-craft
#   Permissions       : Contents -> Read and write
#   Expiration        : 90 days
# Lets Claude push commits. Once Vercel is connected to the repo, a push is
# also a deploy — this token is effectively permission to ship.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# supabase.com/dashboard/account/tokens
# Lets Claude run database migrations. This one is account-wide and can read and
# change customer data in every project on the account, so leaving it blank and
# running migrations yourself is a reasonable choice.
SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
